{
  "name": "xfdmaster.library and xfd commands",
  "version": "39.15",
  "baseline": "2.1.12",
  "archives": {
    "xfdmaster.lha": {
      "url": "https://se.aminet.net/util/pack/xfdmaster.lha",
      "sha256": "4147a2b29a7d007ab5b5a5f855c2a8095c6a9d9cadcb4f238d86cd8ca1424d62",
      "extractor": "7zip"
    }
  },
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "Classic AmigaOS m68k, Kickstart 33 or later for the library",
    "External depackers under LIBS:xfd"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The 1.38 release supplies the exact 39.15 library, seven xfd commands, the installed external depackers and English help.",
    "The archive member xfd_User/Libs/xfd/Ace? extracts as Ace_ under 7-Zip on Windows. The release ZIP and stock hardfile install Libs/xfd/__uae___Ace_.",
    "The xfd copy of X-Systems.TXT maps to the xfd release. Its bytes match the xad copy, and both names are retained.",
    "Checked BCWB inputs preserve the README and X-Systems.TXT project icons. The shared English xfd help drawer also contains the HackProPack documentation assigned to Batch 34.",
    "The shared Locale/Help/english/xfd drawer metadata is catalogued here, including the boundary with HackProPack."
  ],
